      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "(d) Produce in consultation with commissioners, on a regular cycle, an audit plan which each Mayoral agency shall follow to yield system-wide data and agency specific direction for the improvement of economy, efficiency, fiscal integrity and the elimination of the potential for fraud and abuse.",
      "logprob_stats": {
